body:
Hi {{first_name}},

We have received your work. This is your proof of submission — keep it.

Receipt
-------
  Reference:    {{reference}}
  Fingerprint:  {{fingerprint}}
  Assignment:   {{title}} ({{subject_name}})
  Attempt:      {{attempt}}
  Submitted on: {{submitted_on}}
  Recorded at:  {{submitted_at}} UTC
  Deadline:     {{due_date}}
  Status:       {{status}}

Files received ({{file_count}})
-------------------------------
{{file_list}}

What this means
---------------
  - The fingerprint above is derived from the contents of every file listed. If a file is ever changed, it will no longer match.
  - If your status shows as Late and you believe that is wrong, reply to this message with the reference above before your teacher marks the work.
  - If you submitted a draft, you still need to submit the final piece before the deadline — a draft does not count as a hand-in.
  - If anything in this receipt looks wrong, tell your teacher straight away rather than resubmitting blindly.

{{system_name}}
